WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.446 --> 00:00:03.436
Unit four. Hobbies and Interests!

2
00:00:04.515 --> 00:00:11.209
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English, Level two!

3
00:00:11.259 --> 00:00:14.356
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.406 --> 00:00:18.524
Today we learn: Hobbies and Interests. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.774 --> 00:00:23.174
Passion. Say it with me. Passion!

6
00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:29.887
Talent. Say it with me. Talent!

7
00:00:33.395 --> 00:00:36.762
Craft. Say it with me. Craft!

8
00:00:40.218 --> 00:00:44.435
Photography. Say it with me. Photography!

9
00:00:47.936 --> 00:00:51.486
Collection. Say it with me. Collection!

10
00:00:54.982 --> 00:00:58.732
Skillful. Say it with me. Skillful!

11
00:01:02.244 --> 00:01:06.311
Dedicated. Say it with me. Dedicated!

12
00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:14.027
Creative outlet. Say it with me. Creative outlet!

13
00:01:17.517 --> 00:01:20.934
Master. Say it with me. Master!

14
00:01:24.415 --> 00:01:27.832
Beginner. Say it with me. Beginner!

15
00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:35.260
Improve. Say it with me. Improve!

16
00:01:38.692 --> 00:01:42.375
Showcase. Say it with me. Showcase!

17
00:01:45.932 --> 00:01:56.253
Grammar time! want to / would like to. Listen. I want to master photography. I would like to showcase my work.

18
00:01:56.303 --> 00:02:02.907
Your turn. Say it with me. I want to master photography. I would like to showcase my work.

19
00:02:07.839 --> 00:02:15.484
Photography is my true passion and creative outlet. I started as a beginner, but now I want to showcase my talent.

20
00:02:15.534 --> 00:02:16.989
I like this story!

21
00:02:18.081 --> 00:02:23.295
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:23.345 --> 00:02:24.495
Craft!

23
00:02:25.299 --> 00:02:30.490
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:31.690
Dedicated!

25
00:02:32.564 --> 00:02:40.481
Think and answer. What hobby would you like to master one day?

26
00:02:40.531 --> 00:02:41.681
Great answer!

27
00:02:42.882 --> 00:02:46.836
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

28
00:02:46.886 --> 00:02:48.344
Bye-bye, friends!

